# Import log: missing audio / keys

Whenever importing a set of IELTS tests, append an entry to `docs/IMPORT_MISSING_AUDIO_KEYS.txt` (follow the format at the top of that file) listing, per test:
- missing audio and what was done (skip Listening, etc.)
- missing answer keys and whether they were derived (and from what source) or the test was dropped
- missing questions in the source paper
- answer keys corrected from the source
